        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/phantaskippy/{size}/1897_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-09-02T01:52:33.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>OMG, the Operative is a replicant.</p><p>She is the Wraith, Golem Unity and Con.</p><p>She is also Santa Claus. &nbsp;I'm pretty sure. &nbsp;At least the Santa that came to my house when I was nine had a really big knife with a long handle. &nbsp;I think that was a guy though, and I don't think we have a ruling on whether or not the Operative smells of Cigars and cheap whiskey.</p><p>Either way my whole life makes a lot more sense now.</p>",
